  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can imbue your spellcasting with the power of the spirit world, making your magic difficult to predict.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Bind spirit class feature, ability to cast 2nd-level spells.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You infuse your spells with the touch of the occult, allowing the whisper of your bound spirits to guide you as you cast the spell. If you are bound to a spirit when you cast an occult infused spell, you automatically succeed at all concentration checks that you would make to avoid losing the spell.</p>\n<p><strong>Level Increase:</strong> +2 (an occult infused spell uses a spell slot two levels higher than the spell’s actual level).</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> If you prepare spells in advance, you must be bound to a spirit in order to prepare an occult-infused spell.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/pact-magic-feats#toc32\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
